/--
Globally functional enriched-progress streams yield a rejected finite lasso.

This is the exact-replay-strength checkpoint: if repeated enriched states
already choose the same environment round everywhere on the stream, then the odd
recurrent DPA-priority state can be cut at two occurrences after the
no-lower-priority cutoff.  The paper route must still prove the weaker
recurrent-return loop-erasure extraction, where bounded-window functionality is
manufactured rather than assumed globally.
-/
theorem exists_environmentCode_rejected_roundAwareGameExecution_of_functional_rejected_dpaProgress_stateStream
    {In₁ : Type u}
    {In₂ : Type v}
    {Out₁ : Type w}
