  simpa [
    σ,
    UniformOneDirectionalFiniteIndexLemma.noDirectEpochStateStream,
    wordPrefix_execution
  ] using hsummary (executionPrefix σ env n) (env n)

/--
Rejected prefix-state summary/fringe tracking from the same finite-history
prefix invariant used on the actual branch.

The rejected word supplies its own finite prefix `wordPrefix word n`, so the
all-history prefix-summary invariant can be instantiated directly at that
prefix and at `environmentRoundOfWord word n`.  No self-compatibility or
rejection fact is used for this tracking step; those hypotheses remain in the
